/batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\delta,X,f,a,s\\in V\">\\(p,\\delta,X,f,a,s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Limit},\\mathrm{Countable}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Limit},\\mathrm{Countable}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\delta\">\\(V_\\delta\\)</span> (notions from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StationaryTowerCondition}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{StationaryTowerCondition}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StationaryTowerCondition}_S(p,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Limit}(\\delta)\n\\land\\omega_1\\subseteq\\delta\n\\land p\\in V_\\delta\n\\land\n\\exists X\\in V_\\delta\\;\n\\Bigl[\nX=\\bigcup p\n\\land\np\\subseteq\n\\{a\\subseteq X:\\mathrm{Countable}_S(a)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\land\n\\forall f\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X^{&lt;\\omega},X)\n\\to\n\\exists a\\in p\\;\\forall s\\in a^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(f(s)\\in a)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StationaryTowerCondition}_S(p,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Limit}(\\delta)\n\\land\\omega_1\\subseteq\\delta\n\\land p\\in V_\\delta\n\\land\n\\exists X\\in V_\\delta\\;\n\\Bigl[\nX=\\bigcup p\n\\land\np\\subseteq\n\\{a\\subseteq X:\\mathrm{Countable}_S(a)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\land\n\\forall f\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X^{&lt;\\omega},X)\n\\to\n\\exists a\\in p\\;\\forall s\\in a^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(f(s)\\in a)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Conditions are stationary families of countable subsets of their canonical\nsupport.  Stationarity is expanded by closure under every finitary function\non the support, rather than misusing ordinal stationarity on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"30f7fa6c101bbb39","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,\\delta,X,f,a,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Limit},\\mathrm{Countable}_S,\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StationaryTowerCondition}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StationaryTowerCondition}_S(p,\\delta)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Limit}(\\delta)\n\\land\\omega_1\\subseteq\\delta\n\\land p\\in V_\\delta\n\\land\n\\exists X\\in V_\\delta\\;\n\\Bigl[\nX=\\bigcup p\n\\land\np\\subseteq\n\\{a\\subseteq X:\\mathrm{Countable}_S(a)\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{20mm}\\land\n\\forall f\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X^{<\\omega},X)\n\\to\n\\exists a\\in p\\;\\forall s\\in a^{<\\omega}\\;(f(s)\\in a)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":1506,"backlinks":[{"id":"3cd26e6e3fb18aa5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3497","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-condition.md|58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-condition]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","aabdf3005231e9dc","1b3610e6aed65b25","36d7463d215be751","30f7fa6c101bbb39"]}